# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of the
# checkout OS. Git still checks files out using core.autocrlf on your
# machine, so your local files can stay CRLF — this just stops every
# file from showing as "modified" purely over line-ending differences.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
